flowchart LR
  accTitle: NutsNews backend Grafana telemetry flow
  accDescr {
    Backend PR 471 source-stages Alloy scrapes for the worker database API, eight private workers,
    PostgreSQL, Caddy, TLS, RabbitMQ, and textfile signals. Deployment and fresh query evidence are
    still required before those candidate signals can be called live.
  }
  Host["Backend host and Alloy self"] --> Alloy["Backend Alloy"]
  Owners["Backend owns deploy, Alloy and outbox; worker repos own service signals;\ninfra owns Grafana; meta repo coordinates"] --> Alloy
  API["Source-staged worker DB API\nlivez, readyz and metrics"] --> Alloy
  Workers["Source-staged private workers\nports 18081 through 18088"] --> Alloy
  Workers --> Structural["Every ownership state requires deployment, up 1,\nscrape under 180s, exact identity and readiness series"]
  Live["Live 2026-08-01 19:04 UTC: worker_uplift cutover_active;\nolder candidate 71b030, Runtime 1 PR 471 undeployed"] --> Freeze["Temporary freeze: worker merges and runtime mutations;\nno fetcher v2 migration while cutover_active"]
  Freeze --> Reconcile["Reconcile live observation and rollback deadline\nbefore observability deployment"]
  Reconcile --> Workers
  Data["PostgreSQL, sync relay\nand RabbitMQ"] --> Alloy
  Edge["Caddy RED and TLS"] --> Alloy
  Backup["Durable backup last-success state\nand 30-hour freshness"] --> Alloy
  Journals["Bounded normalized journals"] --> Alloy
  Alloy --> Metrics["Grafana Cloud Metrics"]
  Alloy --> Logs["Grafana Cloud Logs"]
  Infra["nutsnews-infra protected apply"] --> Grafana["Dashboards, alerts and\noperations email routing"]
  Infra --> Ownership["Ownership dashboard: backend revision\nand all eight worker identities"]
  Data --> Outbox["Backend outbox availability and oldest age\nseparate from global feed freshness"]
  Metrics --> Grafana
  Logs --> Grafana
  Structural --> Grafana
  Outbox --> Grafana
  Ownership --> Grafana
  Drills["Protected telemetry-only failure drill\nsource; live proof pending"] --> Grafana
